    ["Thank you so much! If it weren't for you he would be dead for sure, look at how exhausted and injured he is. Luckily, as one of the druids, I have expertise in animal care.\nYou can have the knife and take my wand as a token of my gratitude. Be blessed by the Mother Earth."] = "Thank you so much! If it weren't for you he would be dead for sure, look at how exhausted and injured he is. Luckily, as one of the druids, I have expertise in animal care.\nYou can have the knife and take my wand as a token of my gratitude. Be blessed by the Mother Earth.",
    ["Thats my wolf. Orcs stole him and hid somewhere. Would you help me to rescue him?"] = "Thats my wolf. Orcs stole him and hid somewhere. Would you help me to rescue him?",
    ["Take this knife, surely you will need it. Benek is most likely strangled, use it to free him."] = "Take this knife, surely you will need it. Benek is most likely strangled, use it to free him.",
    ["Thats my wolf. Orcs stole him and hid somewhere. I hope you will succeed rescuing him."] = "Thats my wolf. Orcs stole him and hid somewhere. I hope you will succeed rescuing him.",
    ["Right, I should explain the context first. The thing is, the world was at peace in the past and we lived together in the jungle as a druid would do, but the times have changed for worse and we were forced to leave our village. Everyone went their own way.\nOnly five of us remain, we meet once a year in a big tree in the jungle. If you prove yourself to be trustworthy, we might let you join us.\nI don't know where the others are now, do your best to find and help them if needed."] = "Right, I should explain the context first. The thing is, the world was at peace in the past and we lived together in the jungle as a druid would do, but the times have changed for worse and we were forced to leave our village. Everyone went their own way.\nOnly five of us remain, we meet once a year in a big tree in the jungle. If you prove yourself to be trustworthy, we might let you join us.\nI don't know where the others are now, do your best to find and help them if needed.",
    ["For your service to the druids, you may go to our holy tree and fetch a gob of water from the spring.\nOur sacred tree is located in the very heart of the jungle."] = "For your service to the druids, you may go to our holy tree and fetch a gob of water from the spring.\nOur sacred tree is located in the very heart of the jungle.",
    ["Are you coming there to help me?\nThen there is one thing you can do for me. Recently one of my animals got really sick.\nAnd the only medicine I know that could help him is what Ornuld developed. But he doesn't want to help me, seems like he want to see this innocent animal die.\nMaybe you can get this from him, just don't say that I sent you. You can find him in the western part of the jungle, he has his little camp there."] = "Are you coming there to help me?\nThen there is one thing you can do for me. Recently one of my animals got really sick.\nAnd the only medicine I know that could help him is what Ornuld developed. But he doesn't want to help me, seems like he want to see this innocent animal die.\nMaybe you can get this from him, just don't say that I sent you. You can find him in the western part of the jungle, he has his little camp there.",
    ["Come back when you find a shard."] = "Come back when you find a shard.",
    ["I somewhat and exotic animals collector. One of traders told me about Wyrm's egg.\nGet one for me, please. You can find Wyrm's lair on the mountain to the north from here. Be careful, they dont like anyone coming here let alone stealing one of their brood."] = "I somewhat and exotic animals collector. One of traders told me about Wyrm's egg.\nGet one for me, please. You can find Wyrm's lair on the mountain to the north from here. Be careful, they dont like anyone coming here let alone stealing one of their brood.",
    ["I trust that you can find the remaining druids and help them."] = "I trust that you can find the remaining druids and help them.",
    ["For your service to the druids, you may go to our sacred tree and pick a sample of the Griffinclaw flower.\nOur sacred tree is located in the very heart of the jungle. As a bonus, take this necklace. We welcome you to our community."] = "For your service to the druids, you may go to our sacred tree and pick a sample of the Griffinclaw flower.\nOur sacred tree is located in the very heart of the jungle. As a bonus, take this necklace. We welcome you to our community.",
