    ["Did you manage to {help} Benek?"] = "Did you manage to {help} Benek?",
    ["Thank you, from the bottom of my heart. My Leon finally will cure up. As one of the {druids} I thank you also of behalf of the forest."] = "Thank you, from the bottom of my heart. My Leon finally will cure up. As one of the {druids} I thank you also of behalf of the forest.",
    ["Thank you for helping me and the rest of the druids. Now you became one of us."] = "Thank you for helping me and the rest of the druids. Now you became one of us.",
    ["You want to help me? Soon the deer hunting season will start. Those poor animals are in danger! The poachers won't spare anyone.\nI know how we could help them a bit. So can I count on you?"] = "You want to help me? Soon the deer hunting season will start. Those poor animals are in danger! The poachers won't spare anyone.\nI know how we could help them a bit. So can I count on you?",
    ["The best way would be to sneak up into their camp and set fire to wood storage. It should take them a bunch of time to extinguish it and could possibly save some animals."] = "The best way would be to sneak up into their camp and set fire to wood storage. It should take them a bunch of time to extinguish it and could possibly save some animals.",
