    ["I need a shard for my experiment, but I can't find the time to get one lately. I would be really grateful if you could bring me one.\nWill you find one for me? I will definitely pay back."] = "I need a shard for my experiment, but I can't find the time to get one lately. I would be really grateful if you could bring me one.\nWill you find one for me? I will definitely pay back.",
